  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed\r\ndropped kerb by reason of the lack of information relating to swept path\r\nanalysis showing the safe access and egress of the proposed off-street car\r\nparking &nbsp;in conjunction with the existing\r\nlamppost and lack of the information relating to the proposal’s impact on the on-street\r\nparking availability, &nbsp;would therefore result\r\nin an unjustified loss of on-street parking and likely result in an increase to\r\nroad safety given the busyness of Headstone Road. As such, the proposal is\r\ndeemed to conflict with the aspirations set out in Policies T2(B (1) and T4( E)\r\nand (F ) of the London Plan 2021 and Policy M2 (E ) and (F ) of the Harrow Local\r\nPlan 2021-2041"
